<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>吞酸与泄泻分治 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%90%9E%E9%85%B8%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%84%E6%B3%BB%E5%88%86%E6%B2%BB/</link><description>Recent content in 吞酸与泄泻分治 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 14:29:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%90%9E%E9%85%B8%E4%B8%8E%E6%B3%84%E6%B3%BB%E5%88%86%E6%B2%BB/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>分治法：论便血与溺血分治 论腰痛与头痛分治 论遗精与健忘分治 论吞酸与泄泻分治 论中气与中痰分治</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-27-fenzhifa/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 14:27:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-27-fenzhifa/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“分治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;一人同时患数种病症、寒热虚实错杂&lt;/strong&gt;时的分治与合治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;症犯艰难，不可作一症治之，乃用分治之法。然得其道则分中可合，一方可兼治数症；不得其道则合处仍分&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>